{"tool": "draft_reply", "args": {"body": "Yes — every project includes a connection pooler on port 6543 in transaction mode [product/connection-pooling.md]. If you’re seeing "too many connections", point your serverless and edge workloads at the pooler connection string instead of the direct connection on port 5432, and lower the pool size per client. You can adjust the pool size in Database settings.

